        <h1 class="h2"><strong class="bold-text-2">Who</strong> we Are</h1>
        <div>The Nigeria Seeds Information management system NIGSIMS is  a technology enabled service for the liberalization of the seed marketplace in Nigeria.The system has a synergy across different players such as  National Agricultural Seed Council regulations.(NASC) seed companies and seed traders with an overall goal of ensuring the distribution of quality seeds to farmers. <br><br>NIGSIMS is committed to liberating and redefining the business processes in the agricultural ecosystem.<br></div>
